2. The reservations of a room must be done when the hotel is in operation
Each hotel has a FromDate (opening date) and ToDate (closing date). We ensure that a reservation falls within this period.

✅ Solution: Using a Trigger

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CREATE TRIGGER trg_ValidateHotelOpen
ON RoomReservation
FOR INSERT
AS
BEGIN
    IF EXISTS (
        SELECT 1
        FROM RoomReservation r
        JOIN inserted i ON r.HotelID = i.HotelID
        JOIN Hotel h ON h.HotelID = i.HotelID
        WHERE i.FromDate < h.FromDate 
           OR (h.ToDate IS NOT NULL AND i.ToDate > h.ToDate)
    )
    BEGIN
        RAISERROR ('The reservation must be made when the hotel is in operation.', 16, 1);
        ROLLBACK TRANSACTION;
    END
END;


